# NOT ANONYMOUSLY PULLABLE. Measured 2026-09-05: an unauthenticated manifest request
# for this tag returns 401, so a host without a quay credential cannot stage this step,
# and the failure lands wherever the task was drawn rather than in front of whoever
# caused it. Nothing in ninety env files said so until curation round 6, which is why
# this comment exists rather than a schema key -- there is no key for it, and adding one
# the parser ignores would be worse.
# The image DOES exist: readable with this repository's push credential, digest
# sha256:1cbe67a9ab6e6632... (2026-09-05).
#
# It also carries NO `conda:` line, so under the MAMBA runtime the staging preflight now
# refuses it by name -- correctly: there is no form of this step a container-less agent
# can run.
container: docker://quay.io/hallamlab/external_pathofact:2.0
